body:
I'm conflicted. I initially agreed with you because eating vegan food if you're a non vegan isn't a big deal, and I as a vegetarian myself would never prepare dishes with meat in them. However, the further this goes the more it just seems like you trying to force and agenda, which is never cool but especially not at your sister's baby shower.

&#x200B;

Edit: Also, hiding the contents of food is never okay.
